{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_451.json","id":67341,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Whey Protein Isolate Chocolate","brandName":"Puritan's Pride Fitness","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 25077 58216 7","productVersionCode":"Item #58216 B55641 02A","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"12","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet. Your daily values may be higher or lower depending on your calorie needs:","labelRelationships":[],"contacts":[{"contactId":8895,"text":"Carefully Manufactured for","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_3.json","id":8895,"name":"Puritan's Pride, Inc.","streetAddress":"","city":"Ronkonkoma","state":"NY","country":"U.S.A.","zipCode":"11779","phoneNumber":"1-800-645-1030","email":"","webAddress":"www.puritan.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":1,"unit":"lb","display":"1 lb"},{"order":2,"quantity":454,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"454 Gram(s)"},{"order":3,"quantity":16,"unit":"Oz(s)","display":"16 Oz(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":37,"maxQuantity":37,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1305","langualCodeDescription":"Amino acid/Protein"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Our Whey Protein Isolate is a great option for anyone looking for the highest quality nutrition\nto support their fitness goals."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This powder contains protein that is processed using microfiltration to ensure an isolated whey that contains a high protein percentage with minimal lactose and fat.\nThis isolation process separates the valuable protein from non-protein materials yielding a highly purified whey isolate."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"High Quality Protein Source"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"99% Lactose Free\n130 Calories\n30g Protein"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Protein Powder"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Puritan’s Pride supplements are produced from the finest raw materials under stringent quality control standards. State-of-the-art manufacturing and packaging facilities ensure you the highest quality nutritional supplements money can buy. When it comes to your health...choose the best."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For a delicious smoothie, add peanut butter, fruit or yogurt along with ice cubes and mix in a blender.\nDirections: For adults, take one (1) scoop (37g), one to two times daily. Mix one scoop with 6-8 fluid ounces of water or your favorite beverage. Mix in a shaker or blender and drink immediately for best results. Increase or decrease the amount of liquid added to achieve desired consistency."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Calories 2,000 Calories 2,500\nTotal Fat Less than 65g 80g\nSat Fat Less than 20g 25g\nCholesterol Less than 300mg 300mg\nSodium Less than 2,400mg 2,400mg\nPotassium 3,500mg 3,500mg\nTotal Carbohydrate 300g 375g\nDietary Fiber 25g 30g\t\nProtein 50g 65g \nCalories per gram: Fat 9 ~ Carbohydrate 4 ~ Protein 4\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Partially Produced with Genetic Engineering"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Fitness isn’t a destination. Fitness is about constantly pushing forward. It’s running a little longer, lifting a little heavier, and pushing a little harder than you did the last time. At Puritan’s Pride, we understand the journey, and we know that it’s different for everyone. Puritan’s Pride Fitness offers a variety of products to support you wherever you are in your training."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Color, No Artificial Flavor, No Preservatives, No Gluten, No Wheat, No Yeast, No Fish."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: If you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have any medical condition, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use and consult your doctor if any adverse reactions occur."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if seal under cap is broken or missing."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Contents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"TYPICAL AMINO ACID PROFILE (milligrams per 37 g scoop***)\nEssential Amino Acids\nHistidine 558 mg\nIsoleucine 1,966 mg\nLeucine 3,059 mg\nLysine 2,393 mg\nMethionine 602 mg\nPhenylalanine 866 mg\nThreonine 2,184 mg\nTryptophan** 521 mg\nValine 1,738 mg\nNonessential Amino Acids\nAlanine 1,456 mg\nArginine 636 mg\nAspartic Acid 3,274 mg\nCysteine 740 mg\nGlutamic Acid 5,205 mg\nGlycine 487 mg\nProline 2,133 mg\nSerine 1,462 mg\nTyrosine 886 mg\n**L-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added\n***approximate values"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"TO REORDER ITEM #58216 1-800-645-1030 www.puritan.com"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2016 Puritan’s Pride, Inc."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Item #58216 B55641 02A"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"QA Quality Assured"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualC